sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Client
  participant KC as Keycloak
  participant G as API Gateway
  participant S as insight-service
  participant U as usage-service
  participant O as Ollama
  C->>KC: demande un jeton (het-security-realm)
  KC-->>C: JWT
  C->>G: GET /api/v1/insight/saving-tips/1 + Bearer JWT
  G->>KC: clés publiques (JWKS)
  alt jeton absent ou invalide
    G-->>C: 401 Unauthorized
  else jeton valide
    G->>S: route insight-service (circuit breaker)
    S->>U: GET /api/v1/usage/1?days=3
    U-->>S: appareils et kWh consommés
    S->>O: prompt (Spring AI)
    O-->>S: conseils
    S-->>G: {userId, tips, energyUsage}
    G-->>C: 200 OK
  end
  Note over G: service en panne : le circuit breaker renvoie la route de secours (503)
